m độ trễ. Giờ đây, bạn có thể tận hưởng các cuộc trò chuyện video và âm thanh hoàn hảo, chơi game tốc độ cao, tải về video trên nhiều thiết bị - cùng lúc\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTương thích với Alexa: Điểu khiển router của bạn bằng giọng nói, cho cuộc sống của bạn thông minh hơn và đơn giản hơn với Amazon Alexa.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ciframe src=\"//www.youtube.com/embed/K5TDcfr8xTI\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"\"\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"html-content pdp-product-highlights\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/b1/4d/fa/2089debf82a26ef281063e1df1848f5a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/cc/49/51/093ca0d9ecebf7ed73179f934c46273b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/58/2f/01/dc27d2d3f8084ac3d165e1e6b115e5db.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/a8/13/d2/8c0fdb5c68d592f916c397ab0de3ef88.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/e0/59/9b/fce8ba6775909881bc183e6a47c6023a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/5f/93/be/30576451562fc5a2534d34426a4d48f5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/ff/3d/cb/e17221ad026c548258e3cf6cf7aff10c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/22/6f/9d/7cad7edb802bd31fe5594bb027f8f4f0.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e